{#
   Owner Spotlight — the five richest owners in the game, each with up to five of
   their clubs and the division each sits in. Sits directly under Chapter 01 of
   the Journey section (the "create your owner" chapter), which is why it is
   included from _story.html.twig rather than from index.html.twig.

   Laid out as a board of per-owner cards (see .ospot-board in landing.css), not
   one panel of stacked full-width rows: club counts vary wildly, so a card per
   owner in balanced columns stops a one-club owner reserving the same vertical
   slab as a five-club one. The cards carry the gold ring themselves — there is
   no outer ringed panel, because nesting rings inside rings muddied which edge
   belonged to which owner.

   Still its own .ospot-* class namespace, distinct from the Club Spotlight card
   (.spotlight-card) it shares a visual family with, so changing one never
   silently restyles the other.

   ownerSpotlight is computed live behind a 10-minute cache (OwnerSpotlightService),
   unlike the cron-refreshed Club Spotlight — it is two indexed queries, not an
   aggregate over sync payloads.

   Ranked on UserLedger dividends actually drawn, NOT on combined club balance and
   NOT on Club::$totalCareerEarnings (which is being phased out). Only owners
   holding ledger entries appear, so the panel lists however many qualify — fewer
   than five is normal, and the whole section renders nothing when none do. Expect
   it to stay sparse until clients report `dividend_draw` at volume.

   Avatars render client-side from data-owner-appearance via composePlayerSpriteSvg()
   (avatar-compositor.js), the same technique the Club Spotlight uses. Owner identity
   is newer than most accounts, so a null appearance is common — the slot simply
   stays empty rather than drawing a placeholder body.

   Country chips are flag SVGs from public/assets/flags/, keyed by the lower-cased
   App\Enum\Country code (see that directory's README for provenance and for why
   England is en.svg rather than upstream's gb-eng). Each one carries the country
   name as both alt and title, so the flag is never the only carrier of which
   country it is — a 18x13 flag is not reliably identifiable, and several are
   near-identical at that size. The <img> is explicitly sized so the row doesn't
   reflow as flags decode. The leaderboards and community-stats cards render the
   same flags client-side via landing.js's clubCountryChipHtml(), sized to match.

   Club badges render via clubBadgeIconsHtml() in landing.js, the shared helper the
   ticker and both leaderboards use. Every club row carries at least a badge; the kit
   rides along in the same helper output and is hidden by CSS under 720px, where the
   row no longer has width for both.

   The JS hooks are load-bearing and unchanged by the card restructure: landing.js
   walks `.ospot-row`, then `.ospot-avatar-slot` and `.ospot-club`/`.ospot-club-badge`
   within it. `.ospot-row` is the owner CARD here, not a table-style row — keep the
   class on whatever element wraps one owner.
#}
{% if ownerSpotlight is not empty %}
<section class="ospot-section" id="owner-spotlight" aria-labelledby="owner-spotlight-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Owner Spotlight</div>

        <div class="ospot-board-head">
            <span class="pixel" id="owner-spotlight-title">THE RICH LIST</span>
            <span class="ospot-header-sub">Top {{ ownerSpotlight|length }} by dividends drawn</span>
        </div>

        {# <ol>, not <ul> or a div grid: the ranking is the content, so it stays in
           the markup rather than living only in the rendered .ospot-rank glyph. #}
        <ol class="ospot-board">
            {% for owner in ownerSpotlight %}
                <li class="ospot-row"
                    data-owner-appearance="{{ owner.ownerAppearance|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">

                    <div class="ospot-head">
                        <span class="ospot-rank" aria-hidden="true">{{ '%02d'|format(owner.rank) }}</span>

                        <span class="ospot-avatar-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>

                        <span class="ospot-identity">
                            <span class="ospot-owner-name">
                                {{ owner.ownerName }}
                                {% if owner.ownerCountryCode %}
                                    <img class="ospot-flag"
                                         src="{{ asset('assets/flags/' ~ owner.ownerCountryCode|lower ~ '.svg') }}?v={{ landing_v }}"
                                         width="18" height="13" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                                         alt="{{ owner.ownerNationality }}" title="{{ owner.ownerNationality }}">
                                {% endif %}
                            </span>
                            <span class="ospot-owner-meta">
                                {{ owner.clubCount }} {{ owner.clubCount == 1 ? 'club' : 'clubs' }}
                            </span>
                        </span>

                        <span class="ospot-balance">
                            <span class="ospot-balance-val">£{{ (owner.drawnPence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}</span>
                            <span class="ospot-balance-lbl">drawn</span>
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    {% if owner.clubs is not empty %}
                        <div class="ospot-clubs-head">
                            <span class="ospot-clubs-label">Clubs</span>
                            {# A plain count, never a toggle: the payload is capped at
                               OwnerSpotlightService::CLUBS_PER_OWNER, so the remaining
                               clubs aren't on the page to reveal. #}
                            {% if owner.clubCount > owner.clubs|length %}
                                <span class="ospot-more">+{{ owner.clubCount - owner.clubs|length }} more</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>

                        <ul class="ospot-clubs">
                            {% for club in owner.clubs %}
                                <li class="ospot-club"
                                    data-club-badge="{{ {home: club.homeKitConfig, away: club.awayKitConfig, badge: club.badgeConfig}|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                                    <span class="ospot-club-badge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <span class="ospot-club-name">{{ club.name }}</span>
                                    {% if club.countryCode %}
                                        {% set clubCountry = club.countryLabel ?? club.countryCode %}
                                        <img class="ospot-flag"
                                             src="{{ asset('assets/flags/' ~ club.countryCode|lower ~ '.svg') }}?v={{ landing_v }}"
                                             width="18" height="13" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                                             alt="{{ clubCountry }}" title="{{ clubCountry }}">
                                    {% endif %}
                                    <span class="ospot-club-division">
                                        {% if club.tier %}<span class="ospot-tier">T{{ club.tier }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        {{ club.division }}
                                    </span>
                                </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    {% endif %}
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ol>

        <p class="ospot-note">Dividends drawn across every club an owner holds, refreshed every few minutes from Integrity Sync.</p>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
